[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386017871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111376#issuecomment-3386017871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111376","id":3386017871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J0ohP","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T14:00:15Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T14:00:15Z","body":"I think your issue / MRP could use a bit more info, I'm unable to reproduce this using `4.5.stable` following the reproduction steps. The project and steps are also not enough to get an XR project running properly which has me a little confused.\n\nPlease clarify what runtime/headset you're using. It also seems a little unusual to have an XR MRP without a [script to properly start XR](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/xr/a_better_xr_start_script.html), as well as not having any of the needed XR nodes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386017871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386071594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111376#issuecomment-3386071594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111376","id":3386071594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J01oq","user":{"login":"MajorMcDoom","id":13228932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjI4OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13228932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom","html_url":"https://github.com/MajorMcDoom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T14:13:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T19:12:34Z","body":"> Please clarify what runtime/headset you're using.\n\nI'm using a PICO 4 Ultra over SteamVR. Someone in the Godot Discord managed a repro with Quest 3 over SteamVR.\n\n> It also seems a little unusual to have an XR MRP without a [script to properly start XR](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/tutorials/xr/a_better_xr_start_script.html), as well as not having any of the needed XR nodes.\n\nI understand it's not a full XR setup. But that's part of the bug. Starting with XR enabled in the project settings is enough to get these errors, regardless of whether or not the game follows through with setup. This was my attempt at providing a minimal repro, and this rules out anything further downstream from being the issue.\n\nTo clarify:\n- My full XR project also has this error every time I run it from the editor, so it's not just an issue specific to a barebones project without any nodes/scripts, and it is not an issue with improper setup.\n- You still do need to have a headset connected, and linked, to repro these errors\n- Turning off XR in project settings or running in \"Regular Mode\" makes the error go away\n- This doesn't happen in `4.4.1.stable`\n- The errors appear if I run the project, _or_ if I run the scene","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386071594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387377753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111376#issuecomment-3387377753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111376","id":3387377753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J50hZ","user":{"login":"Clancey","id":256046,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjA0Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256046?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey","html_url":"https://github.com/Clancey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/orgs","r