appens, either through WiVRn or Remote Deploy ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3388887265/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413375612","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111376#issuecomment-3413375612","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111376","id":3413375612,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Lc_p8","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T00:40:17Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T00:40:17Z","body":"XR Meeting, we need to find time to properly reproduce this so we know where it originates from.\nIdeally we should fix this before 4.6 is released however current consensus is that the error is not harmful.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413375612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3635183450","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111376#issuecomment-3635183450","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111376","id":3635183450,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YrH9a","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-10T03:17:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T03:17:46Z","body":"So far I'm no longer able to reproduce this in the latest master. Unfortunately I am none the wiser of what the fix was or if I'm just getting lucky atm.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3635183450/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3650691452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111376#issuecomment-3650691452","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111376","id":3650691452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZmSF8","user":{"login":"EviTRea","id":32661913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjYxOTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32661913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea","html_url":"https://github.com/EviTRea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-14T10:44:15Z","updated_at":"2025-12-14T10:44:15Z","body":"Can confirm this still happens to me, with Godot on Steam, SteamVR, wireless connected to Quest3S with SteamLink.\n\nI tried to reduce the factors, and boy oh boy, it's way more specific than I thought.\n\nFirst, I need the SteamVR to be running, and a headset needed to be connected or the error woud be `create_instance: Failed to create XR instance [Error code -2].` Then the headset is no longer needed as long as the SteamVR session is still present.\n\nThen, the cool part:\n```\nE 0:00:03:279   mesh_create_surface_data_from_arrays: Condition \"array_len == 0\" is true. Returning: ERR_INVALID_DATA\n  <C++ Source>  servers/rendering_server.cpp:1207 @ mesh_create_surface_data_from_arrays()\nE 0:00:03:279   mesh_surface_set_material: Index (uint32_t)p_surface = 0 is out of bounds (mesh->surface_count = 0).\n  <C++ Source>  servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/mesh_storage.cpp:622 @ mesh_surface_set_material()\n```\n### These happens with a blank scene. \nLiterlly nothing but a Node, and it still has errors.\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"2115\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5112c147-6d8c-4b3f-823d-84cf7cf627bd\" />\n(And yes, I switched to Vulkan Mobile and OpenGL 3, they still report the same errors.)\n\nSo, I thought, surface data huh, maybe the problem is in XR shader?\nNope, disable XR shader does nothing to the error. They'd be there merely by enable OpenXR in project settings.\n\nI tried filpping the OpenXR properties around, and 1 of them actaully makes the error goes away: xr/openxr/form_factor.\nIf I change the form_factor to Handheld instead of Head Mounted, the errors go away.\n...That also makes VR unusable, so doesn't really solve anything, but I figure this should help with troubleshooting.\n\n\n### TL;DR:\nThe errors OP had, my minimum reproduce is:\n1. Have SteamVR running, SteamLink to a functioning headset to validate a VR session\n2. Enable OpenXR, make sure \"Form Factor\" is set to \"Head Mounted\"\n3. Run anything\n\n\n==============================\nGodot v4.5.1.stable (f62fdbde1) \nWindows 11 (build 26100) \nMulti-window, 1 monitor\nVulkan (Forward+) \ndedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180)\nAMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n31.92 GiB memory","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3650691452/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3673525005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111376#issuecomment-3673525005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111376","id":3673525005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7a9YsN","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T05:08:30Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T05:08:30Z","body":"Ran into the cause by accident, turned out to be the visibility mask logic. Even if you don't  use it, if the extension is available we do attempt to create a mesh from the visibility mask data,.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3673525005/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]